ng the world, even while becoming a supposed terrorist...or TERROR MAN!\n\n\n\n(Source: ABLAZE)"],"ja":["테러맨",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-73161":"2026-08-19T07:47:41Z","serial-73237":"2026-06-10T11:25:28Z","serial-73252":"2026-05-29T12:50:25Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-73161","serial-73237","serial-73252"],"relatedMalIds":[],"rating":6.69}]}